# The Log Downloader's Clear Logs - LOGS > DataFlash Logs > Download DataFlash Log Via Mavlink -
# which the click crawl of 2026-10-14 found drawn greyed (docs/click-report.md, "Not fixed: real
# gaps"). LoadLogList allows it only with a link open; it asks "Are you sure?" (caption "sure"),
# and No leaves everything as it was. Yes is EraseLog - LOG_ERASE to the vehicle, twice, as it
# answers nothing - then "!!Allow 30-90 seconds for erase" and the list emptied, its checks with
# it; Download All Logs over the emptied list asks for the list again.
# Log/LogDownloadMavLink.cs:59-89, 158-167, 450-467; ExtLibs/ArduPilot/Mavlink/MAVLinkInterface.cs:6269-6279
#
# Against tests/gui/log-vehicle.py, which the setup line starts: a copter holding two logs until a
# LOG_ERASE addressed to it arrives, saying "listed N" after each list it sends and counting each
# LOG_ERASE aloud - so "LOG_ERASE 2" is two of them from the press of Yes, and none from No - and
# holding no logs after.
#
# Run as: tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/logs-downloader-clear.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5792
env XDG_DATA_HOME $WORK
env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
setup python3 tests/gui/log-vehicle.py --work $WORK --port 5792

screen logs
window 1600x1200
budget 7
# A first budget, set by hand until a passing run records one.

# The vehicle first: the window asks for its list as it opens.
expect vehicle.count > 0
click logs-tab-dataflash
expect logs.page dataflash
click fly-dfmavlink
expect fly.logs.open true
expect fly.messages.newest listed 2
expect fly.logs.items 2
expect fly.logs.output Found 2 log files, note: item sizes are just an estimate.
expect fly.logs.clear.enabled true

# No: nothing sent, the list as it was.
click fly-logs-clear
expect fly.logs.asking clear
click fly-logs-question-no
expect fly.logs.asking none
expect fly.logs.items 2

# Yes, with a log checked: two LOG_ERASE, the C#'s line, and the list empty.
click fly-log-1
expect fly.logs.checked 1
click fly-logs-clear
expect fly.logs.asking clear
click fly-logs-question-yes
expect fly.logs.asking none
expect fly.messages.newest LOG_ERASE 2
expect fly.logs.output !!Allow 30-90 seconds for erase
expect fly.logs.items 0
expect fly.logs.checked !~ 1

# Download All Logs over the emptied list: the list asked for again, and the copter has none.
click fly-logs-dlall
expect fly.messages.newest listed 0
expect fly.logs.output Getting list of log files...
expect fly.logs.items 0
expect fly.logs.fetching none
